                                "sense_id": "286445c4-0730-36f7-844c-d3b98685802d",
                                "text": "This tenebrosity of the interior, he proceeded to say, hath not been illumined by the wit of the septuagint nor so much as mentioned for the Orient from on high which brake hell’s gates visited a darkness that was foraneous."
